        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu atwai ma mavalũa ala matũlĩte mbalasi syĩ maũũ ila syekalaa ũthũkũminĩ wa mũsumbĩ mathi, makalaatĩtwe na kũkũlũswa nĩ mwĩao wa mũsumbĩ; na ũtw’ĩo waumĩwe nyũmbanĩ nene ya ũsumbĩ ku Susani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
